1442 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 592 0 R
/E (During the project, I also improved my ability to troubleshoot issues, such as data-cleaning inconsistencies, incorrect vector shapes, model-loading problems, and Git version control conflicts. These challenges helped me become more disciplined in structuring code, documenting experiments, and organizing files to ensure reproducibility.)
/Pg 73 0 R
/K [3 4]
>>
endobj
1443 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 592 0 R
/E (     Another important reflection is the value of experiment tracking and visualization. By plotting confusion matrices, training curves, and comparing metrics side-by-side, I realized how crucial it is to evaluate models from multiple perspectives instead of relying solely on accuracy.)
/Pg 73 0 R
/K [5]
>>
